| CORA_V7.8 | Opening / closing coverage per corner (each corner = a mini store), lunch never empties a corner, Sunday single shift toggle. |
| CORA_V7.9 | Frozen planning by default : a manual change stays on its cell, nobody else moves. "Adjust whole planning" to recalculate. |
